      "title": "SKF India Ltd. (Automotive) Announces Appointment of Bhavna Panigrahi as Chief Human Resources Officer, Effective January 1, 2026",
      "body": "SKF India Ltd. (Automotive), the demerged, focused entity of SKF India, has named Bhavna Panigrahi as its new chief human resources officer, effective January 1, 2026. In the new role, Panigrahi will manage the firm's people and organisational strategy, including talent management, HR operations, industrial relations, leadership development, and organisational effectiveness. She will partner with the leadership team to align HR initiatives with business objectives and foster a culture focused on inclusion, performance, and innovation. Panigrahi has more than 18 years of experience in human resources across various organisations. She has served as HR head for Technology Development, before transitioning to head of HR for the Automotive business in SKF India. She led strategic initiatives in",
